---
import Platform from '../layouts/Platform.astro';
import UiIcon from './UiIcon.astro';
import { membership } from '../data/membership.mjs';
import '../styles/membership.css';
---
<Platform canonicalPath="/membership" title="Membership" description="One Digivated Membership gives you one reviewed project spotlight, full News summaries, and the full UI/UX Prompt Packet. $5 once.">
<section class="membership-page" aria-labelledby="membership-title">
  <header class="membership-heading"><p class="eyebrow">DIGIVATED MEMBERSHIP</p><h1 id="membership-title">Digivated Membership</h1><p>Pay $5 once for a project spotlight request, full News access, and the UI/UX Prompt Packet.</p></header>
  <article class="membership-offer" aria-label="Digivated Membership offer">
    <div class="membership-offer-heading"><span class="membership-plan-label">The complete membership</span><span class="membership-once">One-time purchase</span></div>
    <div class="membership-price"><strong>${membership.priceUSD}</strong><span>USD once<br/><small>No recurring charges</small></span></div>
    <div class="membership-benefits">
      <div><span class="membership-benefit-icon"><UiIcon name="sparkle" size={22}/></span><div><h2>One project spotlight</h2><p>Request one featured placement for your project. We review it against our listing rules.</p></div></div>
      <div><span class="membership-benefit-icon"><UiIcon name="book" size={22}/></span><div><h2>Full News access</h2><p>Read the full AI, tech, markets, and security archive.</p></div></div>
      <div><span class="membership-benefit-icon"><UiIcon name="book" size={22}/></span><div><h2>Full UI/UX Prompt Packet</h2><p>Get all 75 prompts, the prompt builder, workflows, checklists, and examples.</p></div></div>
    </div>
    {membership.checkoutReady ? <a class="button primary membership-checkout" href={membership.checkoutUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get membership · $5 once <UiIcon name="external" size={17}/></a> : <><button class="button primary membership-checkout" disabled>Checking Gumroad checkout…</button><p class="membership-checkout-note" role="status">Checking the live $5 one-time Gumroad offer. If checkout is unavailable, try again shortly.</p></>}
    <p class="membership-small">Buy on Gumroad, then verify your purchase below.</p>
  </article>
  <div class="membership-next"><p>Browsing and submitting for ordinary directory review remain free.</p><a href="/submit-project">Share a project <UiIcon name="arrow" size={16}/></a></div>
  <section id="member-sign-in" class="membership-access" aria-labelledby="membership-access-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">ALREADY A MEMBER?</p><h2 id="membership-access-title">Verify your purchase</h2><p>Enter your Gumroad purchase email or license key.</p><p id="membership-verified" hidden>Your membership is verified. <a href="/submit-project?membership=1#project-form">Submit your included spotlight request</a>.</p></div><div><form id="founding-access-form" class="carousel-access" method="post" action="/api/founding-access"><label>Gumroad license key<input name="license" type="password" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="characters" spellcheck="false" maxlength="35"/></label><p class="quiet">or</p><label>Purchase email<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="254"/></label><button class="button" type="submit">Verify membership</button><p id="founding-access-status" role="status"></p></form><button class="button" id="founding-sign-out" type="button" hidden>Sign out of membership</button></div></section>
  <section class="membership-faq" aria-labelledby="membership-questions"><h2 id="membership-questions">Membership FAQ</h2><details><summary>What does Membership unlock?</summary><p>One reviewed project spotlight, full News summaries, and the full UI/UX Prompt Packet. Public project discovery, free samples, and ordinary project submissions remain free.</p></details><details><summary>How do I open the Prompt Packet?</summary><p>Verify your receipt email or license key in the Membership section above, then open the Prompt Packet. You can also enter your Membership license key directly at <a href="/access">digivated.com/access</a>. You do not need to buy the Prompt Packet separately.</p></details><details><summary>Is this a subscription?</summary><p>No. Membership costs $5 USD once. There are no recurring charges or automatic renewals.</p></details><details><summary>How does the project spotlight work?</summary><p>Your membership includes one project spotlight. Sign in, then choose the membership option when submitting your project. Digivated reviews its image, description, and destination before featuring it. Projects must meet the site’s listing rules; payment does not bypass review or guarantee traffic, sales, or engagement.</p></details><details><summary>Can I read News today?</summary><p>Yes. Browse <a href="/news">five free News stories</a> now, and verify membership above for full summaries.</p></details><details id="previous-purchases"><summary>What about a previous purchase?</summary><p>Existing purchases keep their original access. <a href="/access">Open your Prompt Packet</a>, or use the membership form above. If you previously purchased a standalone promotion, <a href="/submit-project?promotion=1#project-form">submit that existing purchase for review</a>. Those products are no longer advertised for separate purchase on Digivated.</p></details></section>
</section>
<script>import '../scripts/membership-access.js'; import '../scripts/membership-checkout.js';</script>
</Platform>
